{"id":"21c138585934c017","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/091_代数化逻辑_Algebraizable_Logic.md","title":"091 代数化逻辑 Algebraizable Logic","display":"091_代数化逻辑_Algebraizable_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-公式代数型\">1. 公式代数型</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=(Op,ar)\">\\(\\Omega=(Op,ar)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar:Op\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar:Op\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。公式变元集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fm_\\Omega\">\\(Fm_\\Omega\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Var\">\\(p\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(p)\\in Fm_\\Omega\">\\(var(p)\\in Fm_\\Omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in Op\">\\(c\\in Op\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(c)=n\">\\(ar(c)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:n\\to Fm_\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha:n\\to Fm_\\Omega\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"app(c,\\alpha)\\in Fm_\\Omega\">\\(app(c,\\alpha)\\in Fm_\\Omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>变元出现函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PV:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\">\\(PV:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(var(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\nPV(app(c,\\alpha))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(c)}PV(\\alpha(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(var(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\nPV(app(c,\\alpha))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(c)}PV(\\alpha(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_\\Omega=\\{\\sigma:Var\\to Fm_\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_\\Omega=\\{\\sigma:Var\\to Fm_\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\)</span>，其扩张满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(var(p))=\\sigma(p)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(var(p))=\\sigma(p)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(app(c,\\alpha))=app(c,i\\mapsto\\widehat\\sigma(\\alpha(i)))\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(app(c,\\alpha))=app(c,i\\mapsto\\widehat\\sigma(\\alpha(i)))\\)</span>。无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-句法后承系统\">2. 句法后承系统</h1>\n<p>后承参数是关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\times Fm_\\Omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_L\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Fm_\\Omega)\\times Fm_\\Omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它被要求满足四条本地结构条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>自反：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>单调：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_L A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>替换不变：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma[\\Gamma]\\vdash_L\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma[\\Gamma]\\vdash_L\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>传递：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_L A\\)</span> 且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Delta\">\\(B\\in\\Delta\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L B\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L B\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭包算子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Cn_L(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in Fm_\\Omega:\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Cn_L(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in Fm_\\Omega:\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-方程语言\">3. 方程语言</h1>\n<p>方程集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Eq_\\Omega=\\{eq(A,B):A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Eq_\\Omega=\\{eq(A,B):A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(A,B)\\widehat\\sigma=eq(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(A,B)\\widehat\\sigma=eq(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程集替换像定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma[E]=\\{e\\widehat\\sigma:e\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma[E]=\\{e\\widehat\\sigma:e\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-代数与方程满足\">4. 代数与方程满足</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>-代数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(|A|,(c^A)_{c\\in Op})\">\\(A=(|A|,(c^A)_{c\\in Op})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(|A|\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^A:|A|^{ar(c)}\\to |A|\">\\(c^A:|A|^{ar(c)}\\to |A|\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Alg_\\Omega\">\\(Alg_\\Omega\\)</span> 为所有此类代数的集合。赋值集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Val(A)=\\{\\nu:Var\\to |A|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Val(A)=\\{\\nu:Var\\to |A|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式值函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket var(p)\\rrbracket_A^\\nu=\\nu(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket var(p)\\rrbracket_A^\\nu=\\nu(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket app(c,\\alpha)\\rrbracket_A^\\nu\n=\nc^A(i\\mapsto\\llbracket\\alpha(i)\\rrbracket_A^\\nu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket app(c,\\alpha)\\rrbracket_A^\\nu\n=\nc^A(i\\mapsto\\llbracket\\alpha(i)\\rrbracket_A^\\nu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程满足为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,\\nu\\models_E eq(B,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_A^\\nu=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_A^\\nu.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,\\nu\\models_E eq(B,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_A^\\nu=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_A^\\nu.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-等式后承\">5. 等式后承</h1>\n<p>代数类参数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq} e\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq} e\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span> 与所有赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\nu\\models_E d\">\\(A,\\nu\\models_E d\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in E\">\\(d\\in E\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\nu\\models_E e\">\\(A,\\nu\\models_E e\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-翻译函数\">6. 翻译函数</h1>\n<p>代数化数据由两个有限翻译给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega\\times Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega\\times Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换相容谓词分别定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\tau(\\widehat\\sigma(A))=\\widehat\\sigma[\\tau(A)],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\tau(\\widehat\\sigma(A))=\\widehat\\sigma[\\tau(A)],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\Delta(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B))\n=\n\\widehat\\sigma[\\Delta(A,B)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in Sub_\\Omega\\,\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\quad\n\\Delta(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B))\n=\n\\widehat\\sigma[\\Delta(A,B)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集与方程集翻译提升分别定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau^{*}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\tau(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau^{*}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\tau(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^{*}(E)\n=\n\\bigcup_{eq(C,D)\\in E}\\Delta(C,D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta^{*}(E)\n=\n\\bigcup_{eq(C,D)\\in E}\\Delta(C,D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-代数化四条件\">7. 代数化四条件</h1>\n<p>公式后承到方程后承的翻译条件定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_{1}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq Fm_\\Omega\\,\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_{1}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq Fm_\\Omega\\,\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\in\\tau(A)\\quad\n\\tau^{*}(\\Gamma)\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_L A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall e\\in\\tau(A)\\quad\n\\tau^{*}(\\Gamma)\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程后承到公式后承的翻译条件定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_{2}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\subseteq Eq_\\Omega\\,\n\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_{2}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\subseteq Eq_\\Omega\\,\n\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,B)\\quad\n\\Delta^{*}(E)\\vdash_L\\delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}eq(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,B)\\quad\n\\Delta^{*}(E)\\vdash_L\\delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式单位还原条件定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_{3}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,A)\\quad\n\\{A\\}\\vdash_L\\delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_{3}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,A)\\quad\n\\{A\\}\\vdash_L\\delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>方程还原条件定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alg}_{4}(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,B)\\,\n\\forall e\\in\\tau(\\delta)\\quad\n\\{eq(A,B)\\}\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Alg}_{4}(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\in Fm_\\Omega\\,\n\\forall\\delta\\in\\Delta(A,B)\\,\n\\forall e\\in\\tau(\\delta)\\quad\n\\{eq(A,B)\\}\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq}e.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-证书对象\">8. 证书对象</h1>\n<p>证书标签集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n=\n\\{s_{\\tau},s_{\\Delta},a_1,a_2,a_3,a_4\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n=\n\\{s_{\\tau},s_{\\Delta},a_1,a_2,a_3,a_4\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>代数化证书集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P):\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\\\\n\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega),\\\\\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega,\\\\\n\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P):\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega),\\\\\n\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega),\\\\\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega,\\\\\n\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cert=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}\">\\(Cert=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}\\)</span>，定义检查通过关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,s_{\\tau})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,s_{\\tau})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,s_{\\Delta})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,s_{\\Delta})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_1)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_1)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_2)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_2)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_3)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_3)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_4)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4}(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,a_4)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4}(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证书合格谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GoodAlg}(Cert)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nCert=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}\n\\land\n\\mathcal P=\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n\\land\n\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GoodAlg}(Cert)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nCert=(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg}\n\\land\n\\mathcal P=\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\n\\land\n\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Pass}(Cert,\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-代数化判断\">9. 代数化判断</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\quad\n\\operatorname{GoodAlg}((\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{CheckLabel}\\quad\n\\operatorname{GoodAlg}((\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K,\\mathcal P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标差异条款\">10. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标特征数据定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz}(\\tau,\\Delta)\n=\n(\\tau,\\Delta,\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\\operatorname{GoodAlg}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz}(\\tau,\\Delta)\n=\n(\\tau,\\Delta,\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\\operatorname{GoodAlg}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega)\n\\land\n\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega)\n\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz}(\\tau,\\Delta)\n=\n(\\tau,\\Delta,\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\\operatorname{GoodAlg})\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau)\\land\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta)\\land\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\\land\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\land\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta)\\land\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4}(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\tau:Fm_\\Omega\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Eq_\\Omega)\n\\land\n\\Delta:Fm_\\Omega^2\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Fm_\\Omega)\n\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq Alg_\\Omega\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz}(\\tau,\\Delta)\n=\n(\\tau,\\Delta,\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\\operatorname{GoodAlg})\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Algz}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau}(\\tau)\\land\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta}(\\Delta)\\land\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1}(\\vdash_L,\\tau,\\mathcal K)\\land\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\\land\\\\\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3}(\\vdash_L,\\Delta)\\land\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4}(\\tau,\\Delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{AlgebraizableLogic}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Omega,\nVar,\nFm_\\Omega,\nPV,\nSub_\\Omega,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\n\\vdash_L,\nCn_L,\nEq_\\Omega,\nAlg_\\Omega,\nVal,\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket,\n\\models_E,\n\\mathcal K,\n\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq},\n\\tau,\n\\Delta,\n\\tau^{*},\n\\Delta^{*},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{CheckLabel},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\n\\operatorname{Pass},\n\\operatorname{GoodAlg},\n\\operatorname{Algz},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz},\n\\Delta_{Algz}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{AlgebraizableLogic}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Omega,\nVar,\nFm_\\Omega,\nPV,\nSub_\\Omega,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\n\\vdash_L,\nCn_L,\nEq_\\Omega,\nAlg_\\Omega,\nVal,\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket,\n\\models_E,\n\\mathcal K,\n\\models_{\\mathcal K}^{eq},\n\\tau,\n\\Delta,\n\\tau^{*},\n\\Delta^{*},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\tau},\n\\operatorname{SubCompat}_{\\Delta},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{1},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{2},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{3},\n\\operatorname{Alg}_{4},\n\\mathsf{CheckLabel},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{Alg},\n\\operatorname{Pass},\n\\operatorname{GoodAlg},\n\\operatorname{Algz},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{Algz},\n\\Delta_{Algz}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含公式代数、赋值递归、句法后承、方程后承、有限翻译和六项检查组成的代数化证书；不含 Hilbert 证明序列、Kripke 框架或某个固定的具体矩阵逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-公式代数型","text":"1. 公式代数型","level":1},{"id":"2.-句法后承系统","text":"2. 句法后承系统","level":1},{"id":"3.-方程语言","text":"3. 方程语言","level":1},{"id":"4.-代数与方程满足","text":"4. 代数与方程满足","level":1},{"id":"5.-等式后承","text":"5. 等式后承","level":1},{"id":"6.-翻译函数","text":"6. 翻译函数","level":1},{"id":"7.-代数化四条件","text":"7. 代数化四条件","level":1},{"id":"8.-证书对象","text":"8. 证书对象","level":1},{"id":"9.-代数化判断","text":"9. 代数化判断","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标差异条款","text":"10. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega=(Op,ar)","display":false},{"t